<title>CANADA: CAODC weekly western Canadian rig count - Feb 25.</title>
<headline>CAODC weekly western Canadian rig count - Feb 25.</headline>
<text>
<p>WEEK OF FEBRUARY 25 VERSUS FEBRUARY 18, 1997	   DRILLING</p>
<p>	     MOVING  RIGGING  DRILLING   DOWN    TOTAL   YR AGO</p>
<p> ALBERTA    9/6     1/0     332/341   13/9    355/356    314</p>
<p> SASK.	1/0     0/0	61/59     3/0     65/59	44</p>
<p> B.C.	 2/1     0/0	57/59     0/0     59/60	58</p>
<p> N.W.T.     0/0     0/0	 3/2	3/4	6/6	  2</p>
<p> MAN.	 0/0     0/0	 0/2	0/0	0/2	  2</p>
