<p>RATE. TOTAL LINE IS TOTAL WESTERN CANADA. FIGURES SUPPLIED BY</p>
<p>CANADIAN ASSOCIATION OF OILWELL DRILLING CONTRACTORS.</p>
<p>-- Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624</p>
